    "Final public gig records reconstruct appearance and membership. Any gig shortened anywhere in the week is excluded conservatively because its original stops are missing; this forensic exclusion uses future history and is not a deployable rule.",
    "Later observed outcomes label exposure; they do not enter the selection rule. Shared driver fees are excluded rather than allocated arbitrarily."
